# Kokomi Furina Yelan Escoffier. ~21s Rot. Kokomi Mono Hydro with Escoffier. Kokomi's skill heals through Furina and Yelan setup before being refeshed by her burst. Yelan ensure that she catches her 2nd skill particles. Escoffier builds full damage and does not burst.

# Team: Options listed by DPS
kokomi char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kokomi add weapon="ashgraven" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
#kokomi add weapon="flowingpurity" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
kokomi add set="ohc" count=4;
kokomi add stats hp=4780 atk=311 hp%=0.466 hydro%=0.466 heal=0.359; #main
kokomi add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.496 atk=33.08 atk%=0.496 er=0.3306 em=39.64 cr=0.0662 cd=0.1324;

